OL,3,GNEWSAChief minister hopefuls quizzed by
OL,4,AMHKs
OL,5,
OL,6,FHousing and the economy have emerged as
OL,7,Fcentral issues in the contest between
OL,8,FKirrie Jenkins and Chris Thomas to
OL,9,Fbecome the Isle of Man's next chief
OL,10,Fminister.
OL,12,FThe two candidates offered different
OL,13,Fapproaches at a hustings, with Jenkins
OL,14,Fcalling for a new, more "collegiate"
OL,15,Fstyle of government and Thomas
OL,16,Femphasising his experience and ability
OL,17,Fto deliver from the outset.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
