OL,3,GNEWSAChief minister hopefuls quizzed by
OL,4,AMHKs
OL,5,
OL,6,FJenkins said the chief minister should
OL,7,Fbe the person who gets "the right
OL,8,Fpeople around the table", while Thomas
OL,9,Fsaid the island had voted for change
OL,10,Fand that politicians now needed to
OL,11,F"turn it into action".
OL,13,FMHKs will vote for their preferred
OL,14,Fcandidate in the House of Keys on
OL,15,FTuesday, 13 October.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
